I
摘要
随着当前地铁建设的快速发展,地铁盾构施工安全生产形势依然很严峻。地铁
盾构施工中的各种安全事故时有发生,这也暴露出地铁盾构施工安全保障中存在
的一些问题。因此,提高地铁盾构施工安全保障能力水平已成为当前亟待解决的问
题。基于此,本文通过对地铁盾构施工安全保障能力进行评价研究,进而对地铁盾
构施工安全保障能力建设中的薄弱环节进行改进完善,从而有针对性的提高地铁
盾构施工安全保障能力水平。本文通过对地铁盾构施工安全事故致因以及地铁盾
构施工安全风险的分析研究,论证了进行地铁盾构施工安全保障能力评价研究的
必要性和紧迫性。本文的主要研究内容如下所示:
(1)在事故发生机理、事故致因理论、安全管理理论、安全风险管理理论的
基础上,结合地铁盾构施工工艺以及安全保障措施,对地铁盾构施工安全保障能力
进行了概念界定。
(2)在对各项地铁盾构施工安全保障措施进行归纳总结的基础上,从人员防
护能力、物需保障能力、环境应对能力、技术支持能力、组织管理能力 5 个主要方
面构建了地铁盾构施工安全保障能力评价指标体系;构建了以 DEMATEL 法、熵
权法、博弈论组合赋权法为赋权方法和以云模型、物元可拓模型、可拓云模型为评
价方法的地铁盾构施工安全保障能力评价模型。
(3)将构建的评价指标体系与三种评价模型应用于郑州某地铁盾构区间项目
的地铁盾构施工安全保障能力评价当中,从而得到该项目地铁盾构施工安全保障
能力的评价等级。基于评价结果,进而提出改进安全保障薄弱环节的措施及策略。
结果表明,所构建的评价指标体系和评价模型能够对地铁盾构施工安全保障能力
实现有效评价。同时,该评价结果不仅为施工企业的地铁盾构施工安全保障能力建
设指明了改进方向,而且对包含地铁隧道工程在内的地下工程盾构法施工均有一
定的参考作用。图 17 幅,表 30 个,参考文献 123 篇。
关键词:地铁盾构施工;安全保障能力;组合赋权法;可拓云模型


III
Abstract
With the rapid development of subway construction, the safety production situation
of subway shield construction is still very serious. Various safety accidents in subway
shield construction occur from time to time, which also exposes some problems in the
safety guarantee of subway shield construction. Therefore, it has become an urgent
problem to improve the safety guarantee ability of subway shield construction. Based on
this, this paper evaluates and studies the safety guarantee ability of subway shield
construction, and then improves the weak links in the construction of safety guarantee
ability of subway shield construction, so as to improve the level of safety guarantee ability
of subway shield construction. Through the analysis and research on the causes of safety
accidents in subway shield construction and the safety risks of subway shield construction,
this paper demonstrates the necessity and urgency of evaluating the safety guarantee
ability of subway shield construction. The main research contents of this paper are as
follows:
(1) On the basis of accident occurrence mechanism, accident cause theory, safety
management theory and safety risk management theory, combined with subway shield
construction technology and safety guarantee measures, the concept of subway shield
construction safety guarantee ability is defined.
(2) On the basis of summarizing the safety guarantee measures of subway shield
construction, the evaluation index system of safety guarantee ability of subway shield
construction is constructed from five main aspects: personnel protection ability, material
demand guarantee ability, environmental response ability, technical support ability and
organization management ability; The evaluation model of subway shield construction
safety guarantee ability is constructed with DEMATEL method, entropy weight method
and game theory combination weighting method as weighting method, and cloud model,
matter-element extension model and extension cloud model as evaluation method.
(3) The evaluation index system and three evaluation models are applied to the
evaluation of the safety guarantee ability of subway shield construction in a subway shield
section project in Zhengzhou, so as to obtain the evaluation grade of the safety guarantee


