ability of subway shield construction in this project. Based on the evaluation results, the
measures and strategies to improve the weak links of security are put forward. The results
show that the evaluation index system and evaluation model can effectively evaluate the
safety guarantee ability of subway shield construction. At the same time, the evaluation
results not only point out the improvement direction for the construction enterprise's
subway shield construction safety guarantee ability construction, but also have certain
reference function for the shield construction of underground engineering including
subway tunnel engineering. There are 17 figures, 30 tables and 123 references.
Keywords: subway shield construction; safety guarantee ability; combination
weighting method; extension cloud model


